// The B02 boss arena (WP-070), the `BossArena-v0` scenario: the Verge's Briar Thicket and the
// Briar Stag, in the Verge's own coordinates so the fight plays the same here as in the level.
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B02 The Briar Stag"; `levels/verge/layout.ron` for the
// hedges and clumps.
//   - The player spawns at (100, 0, -80) facing +X, on the approach, outside the fog gate.
//   - The fog gate is the plane x = 112, 12 m wide, opening east into the arena (+X).
//   - The arena is x in [112, 172], z in [-108, -52]; the Stag waits at (150, 0, -80) facing
//     the gate (-X).
//   - A hedge ring, 4 m tall, closes the arena; two hedges flank the gate (the gap between
//     them is the gate, so it opens onto the arena and nowhere else).
//   - Five briar clumps (2 x 3 x 2 m) stand in the arena. A charge that runs into one, or into
//     a hedge, stuns the Stag for 60 ticks.
//   - The Echo Stone stands just inside the gate at (118, 0, -92).
